    "notes": "FCF CAGRs are null by design: operating cash flow is dominated by policyholder and investment flows (FY2022 OCF 2.0bn vs FY2021 25.1bn) and no FCF is extracted. SBC is <1% of core NI and not a growth driver. DPS grew ~8%/yr 2015-2024 per AR FY2025."
