    "share_count_basis": "380,418,897 registered shares less 176,699 treasury = 380.24m outstanding at 31 Dec 2025 (AR FY2025 lines 14574, 14596). Less ~6.25m for the EUR 2.5bn 2026 buy-back (FY2025 capital return, announced in AR FY2025 line 8618) at an assumed ~EUR 400 average = 374.0m. That buy-back is funded from FY2025 earnings and is NOT in the projected flows, so the share reduction is counted once. Held flat thereafter because future buy-backs are inside the distribution stream (charging them in both the flow and the share count would double-count). Diluted adds only 0.09m (EPS note). NB: the Metrics.csv shares_outstanding of 389.1m for FY2025 is NI/EPS-derived and ~9m too high.",
    "base_revenue_note": "Not revenue. FY2025 shareholders' core net income = core EPS EUR 28.61 x 382.87m weighted basic shares = EUR 10,955m (AR FY2025 lines 7986, 14270; management states EUR 11.1bn before the undated-sub-bond coupon adjustment). Reported NI attributable EUR 10,603m.",
